{
  "$defs": {
    "EquityPoint": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "一个时点（bar 收盘）的组合估值：`equity = cash + Σ quantity × mark_price`。",
      "properties": {
        "schema_version": {
          "default": "2.2.0",
          "pattern": "^(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)(?:-(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*)(?:\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*))*)?(?:\\+[0-9a-zA-Z-]+(?:\\.[0-9a-zA-Z-]+)*)?$",
          "title": "Schema Version",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "time": {
          "format": "date-time",
          "title": "Time",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "cash": {
          "pattern": "^(?!^[-+.]*$)[+-]?0*\\d*\\.?\\d*$",
          "title": "Cash",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "equity": {
          "pattern": "^(?!^[-+.]*$)[+-]?0*\\d*\\.?\\d*$",
          "title": "Equity",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "gross_exposure": {
          "ge": 0,
          "pattern": "^(?!^[-+.]*$)[+-]?0*\\d*\\.?\\d*$",
          "title": "Gross Exposure",
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "time",
        "cash",
        "equity",
        "gross_exposure"
      ],
      "title": "EquityPoint",
      "type": "object"
    },
    "Fill": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "一笔模拟成交（不是订单；v1 没有任何下单能力）。\n\n`fill_time`（成交 bar 的 `interval_start`）不得早于 `decision_time`——结构性无未来函数。\n`slippage_cost = |quantity| × |fill_price − reference_price|`。",
      "properties": {
        "schema_version": {
          "default": "2.2.0",
          "pattern": "^(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)(?:-(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*)(?:\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*))*)?(?:\\+[0-9a-zA-Z-]+(?:\\.[0-9a-zA-Z-]+)*)?$",
          "title": "Schema Version",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "instrument": {
          "minLength": 1,
          "title": "Instrument",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "decision_time": {
          "format": "date-time",
          "title": "Decision Time",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "fill_time": {
          "format": "date-time",
          "title": "Fill Time",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "reference_price": {
          "gt": 0,
          "pattern": "^(?!^[-+.]*$)[+-]?0*\\d*\\.?\\d*$",
          "title": "Reference Price",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "fill_price": {
          "gt": 0,
          "pattern": "^(?!^[-+.]*$)[+-]?0*\\d*\\.?\\d*$",
          "title": "Fill Price",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "quantity": {
          "pattern": "^(?!^[-+.]*$)[+-]?0*\\d*\\.?\\d*$",
          "title": "Quantity",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "fee": {
          "ge": 0,
          "pattern": "^(?!^[-+.]*$)[+-]?0*\\d*\\.?\\d*$",
          "title": "Fee",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "slippage_cost": {
          "ge": 0,
          "pattern": "^(?!^[-+.]*$)[+-]?0*\\d*\\.?\\d*$",
          "title": "Slippage Cost",
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "instrument",
        "decision_time",
        "fill_time",
        "reference_price",
        "fill_price",
        "quantity",
        "fee",
        "slippage_cost"
      ],
      "title": "Fill",
      "type": "object"
    },
    "FillRemainder": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "一个目标在 `next_bar_open_participation` 执行模型下的结转记录（ADR-0054 §3）。\n\n- `requested_quantity`：目标变化量（执行 bar 按执行前权益定量，之后不再重新定量），非零；\n- `filled_quantity`：该目标各笔成交数量之和，与 `requested_quantity` 同号（或为 0），\n  绝对值不超过它；\n- `remaining_quantity = |requested_quantity| − |filled_quantity|`（`>= 0`）；\n- `ended_by`：`filled`（剩余为 0）、`superseded`（同一标的更晚的目标在其执行 bar 取代它）、\n  `end_of_data`（该标的的 bar 用完）；后两者剩余为正；\n- `ended_at`：结束所在 bar 的 `interval_start`（`filled` = 最后一笔成交的 bar；\n  `superseded` = 取代它的目标的执行 bar；`end_of_data` = 该标的最后一根 bar）。",
      "properties": {
        "schema_version": {
          "default": "2.2.0",
          "pattern": "^(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)(?:-(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*)(?:\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*))*)?(?:\\+[0-9a-zA-Z-]+(?:\\.[0-9a-zA-Z-]+)*)?$",
          "title": "Schema Version",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "instrument": {
          "minLength": 1,
          "title": "Instrument",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "decision_time": {
          "format": "date-time",
          "title": "Decision Time",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "requested_quantity": {
          "pattern": "^(?!^[-+.]*$)[+-]?0*\\d*\\.?\\d*$",
          "title": "Requested Quantity",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "filled_quantity": {
          "pattern": "^(?!^[-+.]*$)[+-]?0*\\d*\\.?\\d*$",
          "title": "Filled Quantity",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "remaining_quantity": {
          "ge": 0,
          "pattern": "^(?!^[-+.]*$)[+-]?0*\\d*\\.?\\d*$",
          "title": "Remaining Quantity",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "ended_by": {
          "enum": [
            "filled",
            "superseded",
            "end_of_data"
          ],
          "title": "Ended By",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "ended_at": {
          "format": "date-time",
          "title": "Ended At",
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "instrument",
        "decision_time",
        "requested_quantity",
        "filled_quantity",
        "remaining_quantity",
        "ended_by",
        "ended_at"
      ],
      "title": "FillRemainder",
      "type": "object"
    }
  },
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "description": "一次 `run` 的结果。\n\n- `fills` 按 `(fill_time, instrument)` 升序；`equity_curve` 按 `time` 严格升序、非空；\n- `final_equity` 等于权益曲线的最后一点；`total_fees` / `total_slippage` 等于各成交之和；\n- `unexecuted_targets`：没有成交的目标数（其后无 bar，或在成交前被同一标的更晚的目标取代）；\n- `remainders`（ADR-0054）：`next_bar_open_participation` 下每个已定量目标的结转记录，按\n  `(decision_time, instrument)` 唯一升序；只有该执行模型可以非空。为空时从哈希载荷中省略，\n  既有 `result_hash` 逐位不变；\n- `result_hash` 构造时复核。PnL = `final_equity − initial_equity`（已扣除费用与滑点）。",
  "properties": {
    "schema_version": {
      "default": "2.2.0",
      "pattern": "^(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)(?:-(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*)(?:\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*))*)?(?:\\+[0-9a-zA-Z-]+(?:\\.[0-9a-zA-Z-]+)*)?$",
      "title": "Schema Version",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "request_hash": {
      "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{64}$",
      "title": "Request Hash",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "provider": {
      "pattern": "^[a-z][a-z0-9_]*@(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)(?:-(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*)(?:\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*))*)?(?:\\+[0-9a-zA-Z-]+(?:\\.[0-9a-zA-Z-]+)*)?$",
      "title": "Provider",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "provider_hash": {
      "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{64}$",
      "title": "Provider Hash",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "initial_equity": {
      "gt": 0,
      "pattern": "^(?!^[-+.]*$)[+-]?0*\\d*\\.?\\d*$",
      "title": "Initial Equity",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "fills": {
      "items": {
        "$ref": "#/$defs/Fill"
      },
      "title": "Fills",
      "type": "array"
    },
    "equity_curve": {
      "items": {
        "$ref": "#/$defs/EquityPoint"
      },
      "minItems": 1,
      "title": "Equity Curve",
      "type": "array"
    },
    "final_equity": {
      "pattern": "^(?!^[-+.]*$)[+-]?0*\\d*\\.?\\d*$",
      "title": "Final Equity",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "total_fees": {
      "ge": 0,
      "pattern": "^(?!^[-+.]*$)[+-]?0*\\d*\\.?\\d*$",
      "title": "Total Fees",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "total_slippage": {
      "ge": 0,
      "pattern": "^(?!^[-+.]*$)[+-]?0*\\d*\\.?\\d*$",
      "title": "Total Slippage",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "unexecuted_targets": {
      "minimum": 0,
      "title": "Unexecuted Targets",
      "type": "integer"
    },
    "remainders": {
      "default": [],
      "items": {
        "$ref": "#/$defs/FillRemainder"
      },
      "title": "Remainders",
      "type": "array"
    },
    "result_hash": {
      "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{64}$",
      "title": "Result Hash",
      "type": "string"
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "request_hash",
    "provider",
    "provider_hash",
    "initial_equity",
    "fills",
    "equity_curve",
    "final_equity",
    "total_fees",
    "total_slippage",
    "unexecuted_targets",
    "result_hash"
  ],
  "title": "BacktestResult",
  "type": "object"
}
